---
import { Mail, Star } from "lucide-react";
import { AccentDotsOverlay, DecoratedLink } from "./ui/DecoratedLink";
---

<section id="contact" class="relative py-16 md:py-32 px-4 md:px-8">
  <div class="container mx-auto">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extralight tracking-tight">
            <span class="text-zinc-200">Construyamos</span>
            <span
              class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >
              el futuro
            </span>
            <span class="text-zinc-200">juntos</span>
          </h2>
          <div
            class="w-32 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-blue-400 to-transparent mx-auto"
          >
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-xl text-zinc-400 font-light max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed"
          >
            Estoy en búsqueda de mi primera oportunidad profesional donde pueda
            aportar valor inmediato y crecer junto a un equipo excepcional.
            ¿Tienes un proyecto ambicioso en mente?
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-8 justify-center pt-12">
          <DecoratedLink className="md:max-w-fit" href="#">
            <AccentDotsOverlay>
              <AccentDotsOverlay.AccentDot className="top-3 left-3" />
              <AccentDotsOverlay.AccentDot
                className="bottom-3 right-3 w-1 h-1 bg-blue-400"
              />
            </AccentDotsOverlay>

            <div
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-400/20 to-blue-400/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"
            >
              <Mail
                className="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-400 group-hover:text-emerald-300 transition-colors duration-300"
              />
            </div>
            <span
              class="text-zinc-200 group-hover:text-zinc-100 font-medium text-lg transition-colors duration-300"
            >
              Iniciar Conversación
            </span>
          </DecoratedLink>

          <DecoratedLink variant={"blue"} href="cv">
            <AccentDotsOverlay>
              <AccentDotsOverlay.AccentDot
                className="top-3 left-3 bg-purple-400  h-1 w-1"
              />
              <AccentDotsOverlay.AccentDot
                className="bottom-3 right-3 bg-purple-400"
              />
            </AccentDotsOverlay>
            <div
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-400/20 to-purple-400/20 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300"
            >
              <Star
                className="w-4 h-4 text-violet-400 group-hover:text-violet-300 transition-colors duration-300"
              />
            </div>
            <span
              class="text-zinc-300 group-hover:text-zinc-100 font-light text-lg transition-colors duration-300"
            >
              Ver CV Online
            </span>
          </DecoratedLink>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
